    <entry>
      <title>Go UDP 服务性能优化实战</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/09/go-udp-fu-wu-xing-neng-you-hua-shi-zhan/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/09/go-udp-fu-wu-xing-neng-you-hua-shi-zhan/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>压测一个 Go 写的 DNS 服务时，碰到一个挺反常的现象：机器有 24 个核，压测流量也加上去了，进程 CPU 却一直停在 1100% 左右，QPS 到 2.7 万附近后也不再明显增长。</p></blockquote><h2 id="一、问题背景"><a href="#一、问题背景" class="headerlink" title="一、问题背景"></a>一、问题背景</h2><p>被压测服务运行在一台24核机器上。使用3台机器同时发送DNS请求，总QPS大约2.7万，但服务端CPU只能达到约 1100%，只使用了约11个核，操作系统层面的没有CPU限制。</p><h2 id="二、CPU-火焰图没有达到最终效果"><a href="#二、CPU-火焰图没有达到最终效果" class="headerlink" title="二、CPU 火焰图没有达到最终效果"></a>二、CPU 火焰图没有达到最终效果</h2><p>一开始只看了 CPU profile，能看到日志、网络系统调用和业务处理，去除不必要的日志等，然后再抓pprof，没有哪个函数足以解释为什么只用了 11 个核。后来把block和mutex profile一起抓了：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">CPU profile    看正在消耗CPU的代码block profile  看goroutine阻塞在哪里mutex profile  看锁竞争在哪里<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>只看CPU profile很容易误判。例如，一个请求大量时间在等待锁，它不会一直出现在CPU火焰图的顶部，但它仍然会限制吞吐。</p><p>block和mutex默认是不开的，需要线下开启并压测看,压测版本可以在 main() 开头临时加入：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go">runtime<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">SetBlockProfileRate</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">1_000_000</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// 控制采样频率</span><span class="token comment">// • 如果某次阻塞的时间 大于或等于 rate 纳秒，该事件一定会被记录。</span><span class="token comment">// • 如果某次阻塞的时间 小于 rate 纳秒，则会按 阻塞时间 / rate 的概率进行随机采样（例如阻塞了 0.2 毫秒，而 rate 设为 1 毫秒，则有 20% 的概率被记录）。</span>runtime<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">SetMutexProfileFraction</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>     <span class="token comment">// 采集所有 mutex 竞争</span><span class="token comment">// • 平均每发生 rate 次互斥锁争用事件，采样记录 1 次（即采样概率为 1/rate）。例如设为 100，表示大约每 100 次锁争用记录 1 次。</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="三、把请求解析移出-UDP-接收循环"><a href="#三、把请求解析移出-UDP-接收循环" class="headerlink" title="三、把请求解析移出 UDP 接收循环"></a>三、把请求解析移出 UDP 接收循环</h2><p>原来的逻辑近似如下：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>s <span class="token operator">*</span>Server<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">receiveLoop</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>conn <span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    <span class="token keyword">for</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        session<span class="token punctuation">,</span> err <span class="token operator">:=</span> s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">recvAndCreateSession</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>conn<span class="token punctuation">)</span>        <span class="token keyword">if</span> err <span class="token operator">!=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>            <span class="token keyword">continue</span>        <span class="token punctuation">}</span>        <span class="token keyword">go</span> s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">handle</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>session<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p><code>recvAndCreateSession</code> 不只是收包，还会执行DNS解包、IP定位、配置查询和UUID创建。任何一步变慢，都会延迟下一次 <code>ReadMsgUDP</code>。</p><p>调整后，接收循环只负责收包和派发：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>s <span class="token operator">*</span>Server<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">receiveLoop</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>conn <span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    <span class="token keyword">for</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">,</span> err <span class="token operator">:=</span> s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">recvOnce</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>conn<span class="token punctuation">)</span>        <span class="token keyword">if</span> err <span class="token operator">!=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>            <span class="token keyword">continue</span>        <span class="token punctuation">}</span>        <span class="token keyword">go</span> s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">handlePacket</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>packet<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>s <span class="token operator">*</span>Server<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">handlePacket</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>packet <span class="token operator">*</span>udpPacket<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    <span class="token keyword">defer</span> <span class="token function">releaseUDPPacket</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>packet<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token comment">// 可能会有耗时的操作</span>    session<span class="token punctuation">,</span> err <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">NewSession</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>data<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>n<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>oob<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>oobn<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>flags<span class="token punctuation">,</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>addr<span class="token punctuation">,</span>        packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>conn<span class="token punctuation">,</span>    <span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> err <span class="token operator">!=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        <span class="token keyword">return</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span>    s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">handle</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>session<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>调整以后，收包协程做完 <code>ReadMsgUDP</code> 就能继续读下一个数据报，DNS解包、IP定位和配置查询不会再堵在它前面。</p><p>隐患：每个udp包都创建协程，goroutine会很高，可以考虑固定worker</p><h2 id="四、使用-sync-Pool-复用收包对象"><a href="#四、使用-sync-Pool-复用收包对象" class="headerlink" title="四、使用 sync.Pool 复用收包对象"></a>四、使用 <code>sync.Pool</code> 复用收包对象</h2><p>原始代码每次收包都会分配两个切片：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go">data <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">make</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token builtin">byte</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> dns<span class="token punctuation">.</span>MinMsgSize<span class="token punctuation">)</span>oob <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">make</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token builtin">byte</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">40</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>高QPS下，这会产生大量短生命周期对象，增加分配和 GC 压力。优化后，将缓冲区直接内嵌到池对象中：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">type</span> udpPacket <span class="token keyword">struct</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    data  <span class="token punctuation">[</span>dns<span class="token punctuation">.</span>MinMsgSize<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token builtin">byte</span>    oob   <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">40</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token builtin">byte</span>    n     <span class="token builtin">int</span>    oobn  <span class="token builtin">int</span>    flags <span class="token builtin">int</span>    addr  <span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPAddr    conn  <span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token keyword">var</span> udpPacketPool <span class="token operator">=</span> sync<span class="token punctuation">.</span>Pool<span class="token punctuation">{</span>    New<span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token keyword">func</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token keyword">interface</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token function">new</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>udpPacket<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token function">acquireUDPPacket</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">*</span>udpPacket <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    <span class="token keyword">return</span> udpPacketPool<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Get</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token operator">*</span>udpPacket<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token function">releaseUDPPacket</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>packet <span class="token operator">*</span>udpPacket<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>n <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">0</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>oobn <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">0</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>flags <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">0</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>addr <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>conn <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span>    udpPacketPool<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Put</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>packet<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>读取时把数组转换成切片：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go">n<span class="token punctuation">,</span> oobn<span class="token punctuation">,</span> flags<span class="token punctuation">,</span> addr<span class="token punctuation">,</span> err <span class="token operator">:=</span> conn<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">ReadMsgUDP</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>data<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>    packet<span class="token punctuation">.</span>oob<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="4-1-为什么数组可以传给-ReadMsgUDP"><a href="#4-1-为什么数组可以传给-ReadMsgUDP" class="headerlink" title="4.1 为什么数组可以传给 ReadMsgUDP"></a>4.1 为什么数组可以传给 <code>ReadMsgUDP</code></h3><p><code>packet.data[:]</code> 不会复制数组，它只会创建一个指向原数组的切片描述符：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">Data -&gt; &amp;packet.data[0]Len  -&gt; dns.MinMsgSizeCap  -&gt; dns.MinMsgSize<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p><code>ReadMsgUDP</code> 的参数类型仍然是 <code>[]byte</code>，所以API语义没有改变。</p><h3 id="4-2-ReadMsgUDP-会不会-append，导致底层数组变化"><a href="#4-2-ReadMsgUDP-会不会-append，导致底层数组变化" class="headerlink" title="4.2 ReadMsgUDP 会不会 append，导致底层数组变化"></a>4.2 <code>ReadMsgUDP</code> 会不会 append，导致底层数组变化</h3><p>不会。</p><p>内核只知道一段地址和它的最大长度，不知道 Go 的 <code>append</code>、<code>len</code> 或 <code>cap</code>。因此它只会向调用方提供的内存写数据，不会分配新数组，也不会改变底层地址。</p><p>如果数据超过缓冲区，内核不会帮忙扩容，而是截断数据，并通过返回 flags。</p><h2 id="五、删除热路径上的全局-sessionTable"><a href="#五、删除热路径上的全局-sessionTable" class="headerlink" title="五、删除热路径上的全局 sessionTable"></a>五、删除热路径上的全局 <code>sessionTable</code></h2><p>服务原先为了在监控页显示“正在处理的 Session”，维护了一个全局 map：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go">s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Lock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>s<span class="token punctuation">.</span>sessionTable<span class="token punctuation">[</span>session<span class="token punctuation">.</span>id<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> sessions<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Unlock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token keyword">defer</span> <span class="token keyword">func</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Lock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token function">delete</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>s<span class="token punctuation">.</span>sessionTable<span class="token punctuation">,</span> session<span class="token punctuation">.</span>id<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    s<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Unlock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>所有请求都会竞争同一把锁。block profile显示，约98%的阻塞都集中在这里。</p><p>这个功能只服务于一个低频监控页面，却让每个线上请求付出两次全局加锁的代价，收益和成本严重不匹配。最终删除 <code>sessionTable</code> 及对应监控展示。</p><h2 id="六、单-UDP-socket-也可能成为锁竞争点"><a href="#六、单-UDP-socket-也可能成为锁竞争点" class="headerlink" title="六、单 UDP socket 也可能成为锁竞争点"></a>六、单 UDP socket 也可能成为锁竞争点</h2><p>删除 <code>sessionTable</code> 后，新的block profile显示约97.6%的阻塞转移到了：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">net.(*UDPConn).WriteMsgUDP...poll.(*fdMutex).rwlock<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>虽然Go允许多个 goroutine 并发调用 <code>UDPConn</code>，但同一个fd 的操作仍要经过内部同步。大量请求共享一个 UDP socket 回包时，写路径会争用同一个 <code>fdMutex</code>。</p><p>假设同时有 4 个请求：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">请求 A ─┐请求 B ─┼─&gt; UDP socket fd=10 ─&gt; WriteMsgUDP请求 C ─┤请求 D ─┘<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>但回包时，它们全部调用同一个：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">net.(*UDPConn).WriteMsgUDP...poll.(*fdMutex).rwlock<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>这里的 conn 都指向 fd=10。</p><p>Go 为了保证同一个 fd 的并发操作安全，内部有 fdMutex。</p><p>于是在同一地址和端口创建多个启用了 <code>SO_REUSEPORT</code> 的UDP socket，让内核把流量分散到多个接收队列：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token function">udpListenerCount</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token builtin">int</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> runtime<span class="token punctuation">.</span>GOOS <span class="token operator">!=</span> <span class="token string">"linux"</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">1</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span>    <span class="token keyword">return</span> runtime<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">GOMAXPROCS</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token function">listen</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>addr <span class="token builtin">string</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">error</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    count <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">udpListenerCount</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>    conns <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">make</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> count<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token keyword">for</span> i <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> i <span class="token operator">&lt;</span> count<span class="token punctuation">;</span> i<span class="token operator">++</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>        packetConn<span class="token punctuation">,</span> err <span class="token operator">:=</span> reuseport<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">NewReusablePortPacketConn</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"udp4"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> addr<span class="token punctuation">)</span>        <span class="token keyword">if</span> err <span class="token operator">!=</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>            <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> err        <span class="token punctuation">}</span>        conn<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ok <span class="token operator">:=</span> packetConn<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token operator">*</span>net<span class="token punctuation">.</span>UDPConn<span class="token punctuation">)</span>        <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token operator">!</span>ok <span class="token punctuation">{</span>            <span class="token boolean">_</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> packetConn<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Close</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>            <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> fmt<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Errorf</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"unexpected conn type %T"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> packetConn<span class="token punctuation">)</span>        <span class="token punctuation">}</span>        conns <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">append</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>conns<span class="token punctuation">,</span> conn<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token punctuation">}</span>    <span class="token keyword">return</span> conns<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="七、把每请求随机-UUID-改成进程前缀加原子序号"><a href="#七、把每请求随机-UUID-改成进程前缀加原子序号" class="headerlink" title="七、把每请求随机 UUID 改成进程前缀加原子序号"></a>七、把每请求随机 UUID 改成进程前缀加原子序号</h2><p>原实现每个请求都会生成随机 UUID：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go">id <span class="token operator">:=</span> uuid<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">NewV4</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">String</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>在一次 98.06 秒 CPU 样本中，UUID 路径累计约 2.44 秒，占 2.49%。</p><p>主要开销不是字符串格式化，而是每个请求都进入系统随机数路径。</p><p>这个ID只用于日志关联，不参与鉴权、加密或业务随机决策，因此可以改为“随机前缀+原子递增序号”：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">var</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>    sessionIDPrefix <span class="token operator">=</span> uuid<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">NewV4</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>    sessionIDSeq    <span class="token builtin">uint64</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token function">newSessionID</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token builtin">string</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>    id <span class="token operator">:=</span> sessionIDPrefix    seq <span class="token operator">:=</span> atomic<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">AddUint64</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token operator">&amp;</span>sessionIDSeq<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>    binary<span class="token punctuation">.</span>BigEndian<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">PutUint64</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>id<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">8</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> seq<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    id<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">SetVersion</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>uuid<span class="token punctuation">.</span>V4<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    id<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">SetVariant</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>uuid<span class="token punctuation">.</span>VariantRFC4122<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token keyword">return</span> id<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">String</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>这样每个进程只在启动时读取一次随机数，请求路径只需要：</p><ul><li>一次原子递增；</li><li>复制 16 字节 UUID 值；</li><li>一次 UUID 字符串编码。</li></ul><h2 id="最后"><a href="#最后" class="headerlink" title="最后"></a>最后</h2><p>回头看，这次真正影响吞吐的不是某个业务算法，而是几处共享资源：全局 <code>sessionTable</code>、单个 UDP fd，以及后面的日志写入。UUID和对象分配也有成本，但量级比前面几项小。</p><p>所以排查顺序很重要。CPU profile 适合看时间花在哪，block 和 mutex profile 更适合回答“为什么没有更多代码在运行”。如果只盯着CPU火焰图，很可能会花很多时间优化一个占比两三个点的函数，却漏掉让大批 goroutine 等待的那把锁。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> Go </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>single 防止缓存击穿</title>
      <link href="/2023/09/21/single-fang-zhi-huan-cun-ji-chuan/"/>
      <url>/2023/09/21/single-fang-zhi-huan-cun-ji-chuan/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="什么是缓存击穿"><a href="#什么是缓存击穿" class="headerlink" title="什么是缓存击穿"></a>什么是缓存击穿</h2><p>我们常说的缓存问题：缓存雪崩，缓存击穿，缓存穿透都分别指什么呢？<br>简单来说：</p><ol><li>缓存雪崩是指缓存在同一时间全部失效，导致压力全部转移到DB上。</li><li>缓存击穿指的是某个key在失效的这一刻，有大量的请求数据，这些数据压力也转移到了DB。</li><li>缓存穿透指的是大量数据访问一个不存在的key，导致每次都必须请求DB，DB压力过大。</li></ol><h2 id="如何减少瞬间压力"><a href="#如何减少瞬间压力" class="headerlink" title="如何减少瞬间压力"></a>如何减少瞬间压力</h2><p>像缓存雪崩这种现象，一般是由于缓存服务器宕机（key哈希失效），大量的key设置了相同失效时间导致。可以通过哈希环或者人为控制key的失效时间来避免。</p><h2 id="什么是缓存击穿-1"><a href="#什么是缓存击穿-1" class="headerlink" title="什么是缓存击穿"></a>什么是缓存击穿</h2><p>对于击穿和穿透来说，他们的共同点是同一时间涌入大量相同请求，这些相同请求没必要每次都重新处理一遍，如果我们能将这些请求绑定在一起，返回同一个结果，就能减少大量的并发压力。</p><pre class="line-numbers language-go" data-language="go"><code class="language-go"><span class="token keyword">package</span> singleflight<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token string">"sync"</span><span class="token comment">// call is an in-flight or completed Do call</span><span class="token keyword">type</span> call <span class="token keyword">struct</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>   wg  sync<span class="token punctuation">.</span>WaitGroup   val <span class="token keyword">interface</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span>   err <span class="token builtin">error</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token comment">// Group represents a class of work and forms a namespace in which</span><span class="token comment">// units of work can be executed with duplicate suppression.</span><span class="token keyword">type</span> Group <span class="token keyword">struct</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>   mu sync<span class="token punctuation">.</span>Mutex       <span class="token comment">// protects m</span>   m  <span class="token keyword">map</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token builtin">string</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token operator">*</span>call <span class="token comment">// lazily initialized</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token comment">// Do executes and returns the results of the given function, making</span><span class="token comment">// sure that only one execution is in-flight for a given key at a</span><span class="token comment">// time. If a duplicate comes in, the duplicate caller waits for the</span><span class="token comment">// original to complete and receives the same results.</span><span class="token keyword">func</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>g <span class="token operator">*</span>Group<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">Do</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>key <span class="token builtin">string</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> fn <span class="token keyword">func</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">interface</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">error</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">interface</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">error</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>   g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>mu<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Lock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   <span class="token keyword">if</span> g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>m <span class="token operator">==</span> <span class="token boolean">nil</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>      g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>m <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">make</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">map</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token builtin">string</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token operator">*</span>call<span class="token punctuation">)</span>   <span class="token punctuation">}</span>   <span class="token keyword">if</span> c<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ok <span class="token operator">:=</span> g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>m<span class="token punctuation">[</span>key<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> ok <span class="token punctuation">{</span>      g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>mu<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Unlock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>      c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>wg<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Wait</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>      <span class="token keyword">return</span> c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>val<span class="token punctuation">,</span> c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>err   <span class="token punctuation">}</span>   c <span class="token operator">:=</span> <span class="token function">new</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>call<span class="token punctuation">)</span>   c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>wg<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Add</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>m<span class="token punctuation">[</span>key<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> c   g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>mu<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Unlock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>val<span class="token punctuation">,</span> c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>err <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">fn</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>wg<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Done</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>mu<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Lock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   <span class="token function">delete</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>m<span class="token punctuation">,</span> key<span class="token punctuation">)</span>   g<span class="token punctuation">.</span>mu<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">Unlock</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>   <span class="token keyword">return</span> c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>val<span class="token punctuation">,</span> c<span class="token punctuation">.</span>err<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> go </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
